Ok with that out of the way.
<br />

<br />
I'm having fun with it.  Haven't played my higher level character really, just trying out new classes.  The new SI zones definately did tackle one of the biggest issues I had with the game; in how far you had to run to get anywhere to hunt.  Everything is packed in and definately has groupings of level ranges in specific areas.  I got a bonedancer to level 7 without ever being farther than 4 minutes running to the main city.  Lots of guards available nearby for kill tasks.  And the new mobs are well done (graphically) with very high density in each area.
<br />

<br />
If you come back let us (Bronson and I) know and we will hook up <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="Smile" border="0" />
<br />

<br />
Everyone except Assvaulter...he scares me  <img src="images/smiles/icon_eek.gif" alt="Shocked" border="0" /> 
<br />

<br />
Nic
<br />

<br />
