        <tr>
          <td><span class="postbody">I'm playing it very casually, but enjoying it alot.  I think the game has gotten better overall, much like all of them do in time.  I have found it to be very causal gamer friendly, ie lots of easy to do quests, etc...
<br />

<br />
The graphics upgrade was nice.  The new races and classes are great.  The addition of a battleground at level 14 makes things much more fun for lower levels.  Plus, the addition of realm abilities you earn makes casual RvR in the battlegrounds worthwhile.
<br />

<br />
Also, with ToA the viability of non-RvR in the high levels is now real.  You can spend tons of time just PvE post 50.  (Not that I'll ever see 50 I'm sure)
<br />

<br />
All in all -- good game to come back to.  Like it more than Shadowbane or Star Wars.  Liking it more than EQ at the momment, but EQ is probably the better game, tough call.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
