          <td><span class="postbody">It has been very tempting.  I really did enjoy the game and I can't remember exactly why we stopped playing.
<br />

<br />
It probably had something to do with EQ, but for a while there I know we weren't playing anything online at all..  Burned out I guess.
<br />

<br />
The fact is, I don't think either of us would mind jumping back in, but it would be as casual, if not seldom (not enough to warrant the monthly charge).  Julie also has EQOA (new expansion's out) to monkey with and our EQ guild is hardcore about nightly raiding, so there isn't a lot of time outside of that.
<br />

<br />
If there is a free month deal, and I can find SI as a single package it would be worth checking out.<br />_________________<br />- Me</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
